{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00410",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 3.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Good morning, how are you doing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.88,
      "end_seconds": 9.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.03,
      "end_seconds": 16.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.9,
      "end_seconds": 22.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome. How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.65,
      "end_seconds": 33.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Well, I've been having rumbling and gas. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.66,
      "end_seconds": 37.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.28,
      "end_seconds": 46.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Sumatriptan. I take it 50 milligrams, maybe, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.38,
      "end_seconds": 54.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.04,
      "end_seconds": 59.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.45,
      "end_seconds": 62.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Okay. Would you call it mild or bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.28,
      "end_seconds": 72.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.76,
      "end_seconds": 79.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Okay, take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.55,
      "end_seconds": 82.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "It feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.58,
      "end_seconds": 90.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 90.22,
      "end_seconds": 96.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.93,
      "end_seconds": 107.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.14,
      "text": "I was getting to that! There's cramps as well. I had an occasional queasy feeling before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.31,
      "end_seconds": 113.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Have you had rumbling and gas before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.89,
      "end_seconds": 121.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.96,
      "end_seconds": 134.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "And what about rash, weight loss or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.21,
      "end_seconds": 138.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "No, no rash, weight loss or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.49,
      "end_seconds": 144.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Did you get night-time symptoms, blood in the stool or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.59,
      "end_seconds": 149.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Hmm, no, I'd have mentioned it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.32,
      "end_seconds": 153.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.3,
      "end_seconds": 159.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.52,
      "end_seconds": 163.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Right, any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.34,
      "end_seconds": 169.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Yeah, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.54,
      "end_seconds": 175.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.72,
      "end_seconds": 180.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I, I have migraines, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.25,
      "end_seconds": 189.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "Yes, migraines is known to us, good to have that clear. Alright, any surgery in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.53,
      "end_seconds": 195.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I mean, I had a C-section about ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.89,
      "end_seconds": 214.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.88,
      "end_seconds": 218.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.18,
      "end_seconds": 221.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Right, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.16,
      "end_seconds": 225.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.25,
      "end_seconds": 229.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What do you do to keep active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.93,
      "end_seconds": 235.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I cycle to work most mornings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.64,
      "end_seconds": 240.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.5,
      "end_seconds": 244.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Right, no, no allergies to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 246.4,
      "end_seconds": 256.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.95,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 36.8, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, blood pressure 124 over 69, pulse is 73 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.96,
      "end_seconds": 262.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.77,
      "end_seconds": 268.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Come over here and I'll have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.49,
      "end_seconds": 272.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.71,
      "end_seconds": 294.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and non-tender, with active bowel sounds."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.38,
      "end_seconds": 297.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.05,
      "end_seconds": 317.31,
      "duration_seconds": 17.26,
      "text": "Alright, thanks for that. Taking everything into account, my working impression is lactose intolerance. We shouldn't forget coeliac disease. I'm sending you for a coeliac test because of bloating. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.91,
      "end_seconds": 320.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "How long does that take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.98,
      "end_seconds": 342.93,
      "duration_seconds": 20.95,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a hydrogen breath test because of suspected lactose intolerance. Try two weeks without dairy and tell me if it makes a difference. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.99,
      "end_seconds": 345.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.91,
      "end_seconds": 353.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "We'll catch up in three weeks. Good. Let us know how you get on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.91,
      "end_seconds": 357.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I appreciate it, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.38,
      "end_seconds": 359.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}